# macOS / local build trees and VCS metadata are not needed in the Linux build
# context (the test suite drives libgit2 directly, not the host repo). The glob
# covers every local build dir (build, build-c, build-tsan, build-on/off, …);
# macOS build trees carry extended attributes (e.g. libtool's __.SYMDEF) that
# break Docker's context sender if they leak in.
build*/
.git/
